WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:05.240
Your heart is shouting,

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.260
"Be strong and sad!"

00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:10.290
Just a little more,

00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:12.180
Just a little bit more,

00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:16.720
Raise your hands!

00:00:23.350 --> 00:00:27.550
I'm sure you won't realize it,

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:31.760
But you're the same as you always were.

00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:36.490
You smiled at me,

00:00:37.090 --> 00:00:42.520
Like a leaf swaying in the wind.

00:00:41.920 --> 00:00:49.240
It seems as though my heart is going to explode.

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:54.330
Your heart is shouting,

00:00:53.910 --> 00:00:57.020
"Be strong and sad!"

00:00:56.850 --> 00:00:59.160
Just a little more,

00:00:58.560 --> 00:01:01.050
Just a little bit more,

00:01:00.700 --> 00:01:04.970
Raise your hands!

00:01:04.590 --> 00:01:09.620
Someday, you will be gentle,

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:12.820
And understand what I'm saying to you!

00:01:12.480 --> 00:01:16.640
It'll be all right, no matter where you go,

00:01:16.290 --> 00:01:21.660
This excitement will never stop!

00:01:35.860 --> 00:01:36.570
Ready...

00:01:49.420 --> 00:01:51.090
How was my time?

00:01:53.750 --> 00:01:55.170
I... see.

00:02:06.180 --> 00:02:07.730
Sports Day is nearly here!

00:02:07.940 --> 00:02:08.980
I can't wait!

00:02:09.480 --> 00:02:11.230
There's a rumor about how it's going to be really extreme this year!

00:02:11.610 --> 00:02:14.570
Will our class be able to win?

00:02:14.570 --> 00:02:16.740
It'll be easy as long as we've got Sayuri!

00:02:17.320 --> 00:02:18.700
It won't be that easy.

00:02:19.450 --> 00:02:22.700
We can't win unless we all work together.

00:02:23.450 --> 00:02:26.370
Will Riku-kun be happy to see this boxed lunch?

00:02:26.700 --> 00:02:28.500
Ding-dong-dang-dong!

00:02:28.500 --> 00:02:31.330
We will now begin a Student Council Event!

00:02:32.130 --> 00:02:36.130
Today's target is the same as yesterday's - Aoba Riku-kun from Class 2-A.

00:02:36.460 --> 00:02:41.680
The first one to catch him will win a special headband worn by maids!

00:02:44.970 --> 00:02:48.810
Why does he only pick on me?!

00:02:50.020 --> 00:02:51.100
Oh, Riku-kun.

00:02:53.650 --> 00:02:54.650
Your boxed lunch...

00:02:57.070 --> 00:02:59.150
All Aoba-kun does is play around.

00:02:59.150 --> 00:03:00.860
Will he be all right on Sports Day?

00:03:02.200 --> 00:03:05.790
If Aoba-kun reaches the statue, the event is over!

00:03:06.160 --> 00:03:08.790
Go for it, everyone!

00:03:11.300 --> 00:03:12.280
This is hopeless...

00:03:14.290 --> 00:03:16.210
All right!

00:03:20.340 --> 00:03:21.680
Now you've won three events in a row.

00:03:22.260 --> 00:03:23.510
You're pretty good, Aoba-kun.

00:03:24.550 --> 00:03:25.970
Thank you, Sakurai-kun.

00:03:30.770 --> 00:03:34.230
Hey, do you think Aoba's changed?

00:03:32.770 --> 00:03:35.020
Well, it looks good on me. I'm pretty happy.

00:03:36.570 --> 00:03:37.230
I guess.

00:03:42.780 --> 00:03:44.070
I'm sure the pool is...

00:03:51.290 --> 00:03:52.790
Why do they bounce so much?

00:03:53.790 --> 00:03:55.840
I wanna shove my face in their cleavage!

00:04:03.590 --> 00:04:06.010
Please try your best, everyone.

00:04:07.050 --> 00:04:09.970
The preliminary contest is coming up soon.

00:04:12.980 --> 00:04:14.770
What's wrong, Yayoi-san?

00:04:15.730 --> 00:04:16.980
Utsumi-sempai.

00:04:17.730 --> 00:04:20.480
By any chance, did your time not improve?

00:04:20.860 --> 00:04:21.570
No.

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:23.950
I haven't been feeling myself lately.

00:04:24.320 --> 00:04:26.070
These things happen.

00:04:26.530 --> 00:04:31.450
I was worried too, when I couldn't improve my times.

00:04:32.660 --> 00:04:34.460
You were... worried?

00:04:34.710 --> 00:04:39.460
But you know, those worries went away when I immersed myself in my swimming.

00:04:40.210 --> 00:04:42.050
So if you're worried, you should swim.

00:04:42.510 --> 00:04:43.760
Okay, Yayoi-san?

00:04:44.090 --> 00:04:44.800
Yes.

00:04:45.340 --> 00:04:47.680
Okay, let's swim another lap.

00:04:48.050 --> 00:04:49.720
I'll take a look at your form.

00:04:50.470 --> 00:04:51.770
P-Please do.

00:04:53.350 --> 00:04:54.480
Utsumi-san!

00:04:54.480 --> 00:04:56.980
Who brought you up so well?

00:04:57.770 --> 00:05:02.320
Curse this glass! If this glass window wasn't here, I'd be able to get a closer look!

00:05:06.570 --> 00:05:07.280
Yes!

00:05:11.740 --> 00:05:14.830
Please use this, Aoba-san.

00:05:16.540 --> 00:05:18.830
I have to give this back to Yayoi-san.

00:05:22.210 --> 00:05:23.090
I get it now.

00:05:27.890 --> 00:05:30.100
Okay, that's all for today's class.

00:05:31.600 --> 00:05:33.100
I'll see you all tomorrow.

00:05:33.770 --> 00:05:39.480
Say... it's almost time for Sports Day, so I think we should all do some practice.

00:05:40.020 --> 00:05:41.110
Good idea.

00:05:41.110 --> 00:05:42.570
When all's said and done, we'd like to win.

00:05:42.570 --> 00:05:44.030
When should we start?

00:05:44.030 --> 00:05:45.360
How about after school tomorrow?

00:05:45.950 --> 00:05:48.490
Sorry! I've got club tomorrow.

00:05:49.070 --> 00:05:51.740
Then should those who have time train?

00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:53.160
Like with the boys or something.

00:05:53.450 --> 00:05:54.500
I'll join in!

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:55.700
Me too!

00:05:58.210 --> 00:05:59.000
Inukai-kun.

00:05:59.420 --> 00:06:01.130
Are you free after school tomorrow?

00:06:01.840 --> 00:06:02.750
If it's all right with you...

00:06:02.750 --> 00:06:03.460
Shut it.

00:06:04.670 --> 00:06:06.720
Don't get me involved.

00:06:07.630 --> 00:06:08.300
You're a nuisance.

00:06:10.050 --> 00:06:11.050
What's his problem?

00:06:11.050 --> 00:06:12.510
He's creepy.

00:06:12.510 --> 00:06:15.060
He's been that way for a while, too.

00:06:15.640 --> 00:06:16.680
No kidding.

00:06:17.140 --> 00:06:18.100
Who cares?

00:06:18.100 --> 00:06:18.940
Let's leave him alone.

00:06:19.230 --> 00:06:20.310
Yeah!

00:06:20.310 --> 00:06:21.690
Let's train by ourselves!

00:06:22.610 --> 00:06:26.690
Okay, in that case let's meet after school tomorrow at the sports track.

00:06:27.440 --> 00:06:29.780
Let's all do our best and win first place!

00:06:29.860 --> 00:06:30.990
YEAH!!!

00:06:35.410 --> 00:06:36.120
Okay.

00:06:37.040 --> 00:06:39.370
A-O-BA!

00:06:39.870 --> 00:06:45.550
Where---might---you---be---go---ing?

00:06:49.380 --> 00:06:51.010
H-Hey!

00:06:51.010 --> 00:06:52.090
Where are you taking me?

00:06:52.090 --> 00:06:53.100
Now, now.

00:06:53.100 --> 00:06:54.260
Just come along.

00:06:54.430 --> 00:06:58.430
I-I-I-I have something important to do!

00:07:01.060 --> 00:07:03.150
Um, I'm busy, so...

00:07:03.520 --> 00:07:06.730
What? Are you afraid you won't have time to see Yayoi-san?

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:13.490
You're pretty good, Aoba. You're chasing after your juniors, too.

00:07:13.740 --> 00:07:15.030
I-I'm not!

00:07:15.030 --> 00:07:18.200
I was going there to return the handkerchief she lent to me.

00:07:18.410 --> 00:07:20.290
You don't have to hide it, Aoba.

00:07:20.290 --> 00:07:23.210
Like I said, I'm not hiding anything!

00:07:23.380 --> 00:07:28.340
Even so, you were staring pretty intensely at Yayoi-san, Riku-kun.

00:07:35.800 --> 00:07:37.640
Yayoi Mina of Class 1-C.

00:07:37.930 --> 00:07:40.060
Born on the 11th of March, blood type AB.

00:07:40.390 --> 00:07:41.980
148cm tall.

00:07:41.980 --> 00:07:43.690
Her hobby is collecting dolphin merchandise.

00:07:43.690 --> 00:07:45.060
She's in the swim club.

00:07:46.520 --> 00:07:48.780
Wh-Where did you get all that information?

00:07:49.070 --> 00:07:51.030
Oh, you're amazing, Yuusuke.

00:07:51.450 --> 00:07:52.530
You've already investigated this much.

00:07:52.820 --> 00:07:53.860
I guess.

00:07:53.860 --> 00:07:57.700
Yayoi-san enrolled here this year, but she's one of the most popular girls at school.

00:07:58.290 --> 00:08:05.210
Especially among those guys who want to protect her when they see her unassuming eyes.

00:08:06.090 --> 00:08:10.090
But her most endearing quality is her participation in sports.

00:08:11.300 --> 00:08:12.170
What do you mean?

00:08:12.170 --> 00:08:13.010
Listen up.

00:08:13.010 --> 00:08:19.770
Simply playing sports is enough to make a girl 20% to 30% more popular.

00:08:20.560 --> 00:08:22.890
She wears her school uniform to class,

00:08:22.890 --> 00:08:25.900
but when she plays sports, she plays hard, and you can see her bodyline under her PE gear.

00:08:25.900 --> 00:08:27.940
That alone is enough to be attractive.

00:08:28.110 --> 00:08:34.820
Training hard makes the PE gear moist with sweat, and her swimsuit tightens itself around her body!

00:08:34.820 --> 00:08:39.330
And then, you can see her silky skin!

00:08:39.700 --> 00:08:44.670
Anyone who sees her training can catch a furtive glimpse of her without getting into trouble!

00:08:44.670 --> 00:08:46.460
They look at her with enthralled eyes!

00:08:46.460 --> 00:08:51.590
It's like a masterpiece of art!

00:08:51.590 --> 00:08:53.260
It's the ultimate beauty!

00:08:57.300 --> 00:08:58.010
W-Well...

00:08:58.180 --> 00:08:59.890
Sorry. I don't see what you're getting at.

00:09:03.560 --> 00:09:04.770
I guess I have no choice.

00:09:04.770 --> 00:09:07.060
Maybe this will help you understand.

00:09:08.480 --> 00:09:09.900
This happened last year.

00:09:11.030 --> 00:09:14.900
Amamiya-san was training for the high jump in PE.

00:09:15.740 --> 00:09:19.870
It was as though she was flying elegantly through the air.

00:09:22.330 --> 00:09:31.210
A famous artist happened to see her and made a painting of Amamiya-san.

00:09:33.420 --> 00:09:37.380
That painting was named "The Goddess Flying Through the Sky".

00:09:37.840 --> 00:09:42.010
Even now, it's displayed in a famous art gallery.

00:09:45.930 --> 00:09:47.440
That HAS to be a lie.

00:09:47.940 --> 00:09:53.150
Well, Amamiya's a nice girl, but I don't know what your taste in girls is.

00:09:53.320 --> 00:09:54.860
What do you mean by that?

00:09:55.030 --> 00:09:56.240
What do I mean?

00:09:56.650 --> 00:09:59.320
Are you saying that I made a mistake?

00:09:59.320 --> 00:10:01.410
Not really...

00:10:01.740 --> 00:10:04.540
He just thinks that you do too much research into these girls...

00:10:06.750 --> 00:10:08.620
H-Hey, Yuusuke!

00:10:08.620 --> 00:10:10.000
Hey! Where are you taking us?

00:10:10.170 --> 00:10:12.420
I can't let you get away with saying that.

00:10:12.800 --> 00:10:16.760
I'll teach you the magnificence of girls who play sports!

00:10:17.130 --> 00:10:22.100
L-Like I said, I have something important to do!

00:10:24.640 --> 00:10:26.390
Tokimeki Memorial - Only Love.

00:10:26.890 --> 00:10:27.850
I'm Yayoi Mina.

00:10:29.770 --> 00:10:31.860
Tokimeki Memorial - Only Love.

00:10:31.860 --> 00:10:32.940
I'm Utsumi Koayu.

00:10:42.410 --> 00:10:44.120
Yajima Youko-san. She's in the archery club.

00:10:44.580 --> 00:10:50.580
The difference between her concerned face and her relieved smile after she finishes her practice is very appealing.

00:10:51.170 --> 00:10:51.920
I see.

00:10:54.670 --> 00:10:56.760
Ootama Hiromi-san. She's the captain of the volleyball team.

00:10:57.050 --> 00:10:58.720
What do you think of those strict eyes?

00:10:58.720 --> 00:11:00.380
And that flawless bodyline?

00:11:00.380 --> 00:11:02.550
Isn't she just like a work of art?

00:11:07.350 --> 00:11:09.600
Shirakawa Tamami. She's the manager of the baseball team.

00:11:10.390 --> 00:11:14.060
She works hard for the team, but she always manages to keep a smile on her face.

00:11:14.360 --> 00:11:17.110
She's like a flower in a war zone.

00:11:17.730 --> 00:11:19.490
You investigate managers, too?

00:11:24.780 --> 00:11:26.290
Souma Yui. She's in the athletics club.

00:11:27.450 --> 00:11:31.170
You can see her white silky skin through her uniform.

00:11:31.170 --> 00:11:32.960
She's got a healthy, suntanned face.

00:11:33.380 --> 00:11:36.000
Only an innocent girl could have such contradictory features!

00:11:36.300 --> 00:11:38.340
Oh, they're so lovely...

00:11:38.630 --> 00:11:40.170
Do you know what he's going on about, Aoba?

00:11:40.630 --> 00:11:42.010
No, not at all.

00:11:42.470 --> 00:11:45.260
What did you just say?

00:11:46.510 --> 00:11:52.140
Even if you're my best friends, if you STILL can't understand it...

00:11:52.900 --> 00:11:56.230
You'll just have to follow me...

00:11:55.860 --> 00:11:57.690
All right! We get it, so...

00:11:57.730 --> 00:11:59.990
Hey wait, Yuusuke...

00:12:02.990 --> 00:12:06.490
Oh, we have the same tastes.

00:12:12.710 --> 00:12:14.210
You're so terrified.

00:12:14.880 --> 00:12:15.960
You're so pure.

00:12:16.210 --> 00:12:18.500
Kurotokage-sensei! What are you doing here?

00:12:19.760 --> 00:12:21.880
I came to take a look at their beauty.

00:12:22.220 --> 00:12:26.850
I see! You came to witness my beauty, did you not?

00:12:29.600 --> 00:12:30.600
Tokimeki!

00:12:34.770 --> 00:12:37.110
Those who are beautiful are destined to be admired!

00:12:37.110 --> 00:12:40.610
Admire me some more!

00:12:41.820 --> 00:12:45.320
Come on, let's take a look together.

00:12:45.740 --> 00:12:48.450
Let's look at the bodies of men as they move and throb!

00:12:48.450 --> 00:12:49.620
The world of true beauty!

00:12:49.620 --> 00:12:51.290
Yes! Hurry!

00:12:51.290 --> 00:12:52.450
Come closer!

00:12:52.500 --> 00:12:54.080
Come with me!

00:12:54.670 --> 00:12:55.210
This...

00:12:55.620 --> 00:12:56.880
Hey. Let's get outta here.

00:12:57.000 --> 00:12:57.960
Y-Yeah.

00:12:59.840 --> 00:13:00.630
Hey.

00:13:06.930 --> 00:13:07.800
We're safe now.

00:13:10.720 --> 00:13:12.020
You guys!

00:13:12.020 --> 00:13:15.270
You're the ones who've been peeping at our club!

00:13:15.390 --> 00:13:16.650
Akaoni-sensei!

00:13:15.390 --> 00:13:16.650
(Note: Akaoni means "red demon".)

00:13:16.730 --> 00:13:18.360
My name is Akaboshi!

00:13:18.770 --> 00:13:19.730
Hold it!

00:13:19.730 --> 00:13:23.360
I'll punish you until you remember my name!

00:13:24.860 --> 00:13:28.870
I meant it as a joke, but I guess I overdid it.

00:13:36.120 --> 00:13:38.080
Shit! Where'd they run off to?

00:13:42.050 --> 00:13:42.920
What'll we do?

00:13:42.920 --> 00:13:43.630
Yuusuke?

00:13:46.590 --> 00:13:48.970
Huh? Where'd they go off to?

00:13:54.020 --> 00:13:55.270
Hey, Yuusuke.

00:13:55.270 --> 00:13:56.890
We should stop spying on...

00:13:57.640 --> 00:14:02.940
Not yet. Not until I teach you the
magnificence of girls who play sports.

00:14:04.860 --> 00:14:05.570
Yuusuke.

00:14:06.110 --> 00:14:06.820
You...

00:14:08.070 --> 00:14:09.110
All right, Yuusuke.

00:14:09.360 --> 00:14:10.780
I'll stick by you till the end.

00:14:11.160 --> 00:14:12.580
Okay! We're going to the pool next.

00:14:12.780 --> 00:14:13.790
Let's go, Icchi!

00:14:13.870 --> 00:14:14.660
Hey.

00:14:15.080 --> 00:14:17.870
But how will we fool Akaoni?

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:20.540
Don't worry. I've solved that problem.

00:14:23.050 --> 00:14:24.420
Thanks for waiting!

00:14:24.960 --> 00:14:27.670
I've come here to deliver your order!

00:14:27.970 --> 00:14:29.340
Miss... Where'd you come from?

00:14:30.050 --> 00:14:32.390
Don't worry about the details.

00:14:32.800 --> 00:14:33.970
More importantly...

00:14:33.970 --> 00:14:35.810
These are first-rate costumes!

00:14:37.270 --> 00:14:39.190
Aren't these full-body swimsuits?

00:14:39.600 --> 00:14:40.690
Tsk, tsk, tsk.

00:14:41.360 --> 00:14:43.520
They're no ordinary swimsuits.

00:14:44.070 --> 00:14:49.070
I got these from a military base. They're the latest design with stealth capabilities!

00:14:49.070 --> 00:14:52.240
If you have it, you can infiltrate any location!

00:14:54.410 --> 00:14:55.490
Okay. I'll take it.

00:14:56.370 --> 00:14:57.200
Thanks for coming!

00:14:58.910 --> 00:15:00.330
Let's go, Icchi.

00:15:00.710 --> 00:15:01.500
H-Hey!

00:15:01.500 --> 00:15:02.460
Will these really work?

00:15:02.880 --> 00:15:04.290
Never mind! Just come on!

00:15:10.300 --> 00:15:13.050
Where did those two go?

00:15:13.300 --> 00:15:14.010
Aoba.

00:15:16.180 --> 00:15:17.060
So that's where you were.

00:15:18.180 --> 00:15:19.060
Doujima-kun.

00:15:19.060 --> 00:15:19.730
What is it?

00:15:20.140 --> 00:15:21.560
You broke your promise!

00:15:21.940 --> 00:15:26.440
You were looking at girls other than Amamiya!

00:15:27.230 --> 00:15:28.280
Sorry!

00:15:28.280 --> 00:15:30.650
I can tell that talking won't solve anything...

00:15:30.990 --> 00:15:32.070
No excuses!

00:15:32.070 --> 00:15:35.160
I will punish you for your lies!

00:15:44.500 --> 00:15:45.790
Piyo...

00:15:48.960 --> 00:15:50.090
Hiyoko-kun!

00:15:50.280 --> 00:15:51.750
That was dangerous, Riku-kun

00:15:52.340 --> 00:15:53.840
Thanks. You really saved me.

00:15:54.640 --> 00:15:55.760
Oh, that's right.

00:15:55.760 --> 00:15:57.470
Have you seen Yuusuke and Icchi?

00:15:57.680 --> 00:15:58.930
I got separated from them earlier.

00:15:59.120 --> 00:16:02.040
By the way, isn't there a place you're supposed to go?

00:16:04.190 --> 00:16:05.120
So go now, Riku-kun!

00:16:05.220 --> 00:16:08.090
Don't neglect your friend's sacrifice. Live as one wishes!!

00:16:09.320 --> 00:16:10.690
I understand, Hiyoko-kun.

00:16:11.860 --> 00:16:12.400
I'll see you later.

00:16:14.080 --> 00:16:15.840
Be a Man, Riku-kun

00:16:21.580 --> 00:16:23.080
Worries?

00:16:23.460 --> 00:16:24.670
Th-Thank you.

00:16:26.130 --> 00:16:28.710
Huh? How do you know my name?

00:16:30.710 --> 00:16:33.090
Why did I do that?

00:16:37.350 --> 00:16:38.180
Aoba-san.

00:16:44.190 --> 00:16:45.850
I should swim to forget my worries.

00:16:46.230 --> 00:16:47.020
All right.

00:17:01.870 --> 00:17:03.580
How about that, Icchi?

00:17:03.580 --> 00:17:04.580
Isn't this a good view?

00:17:05.120 --> 00:17:06.580
I'd expect nothing less from stealth clothing.

00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:10.090
We can swim all we want, and nobody will notice us!

00:17:10.550 --> 00:17:13.220
It's from a military base, after all.

00:17:13.630 --> 00:17:15.970
Come on. Let's take full advantage of this.

00:17:16.300 --> 00:17:17.430
Yeah.

00:17:28.440 --> 00:17:29.770
What's going on?

00:17:30.820 --> 00:17:34.070
There are boys with swimsuits in the pool.

00:17:34.490 --> 00:17:35.450
Swimsuits?

00:17:37.740 --> 00:17:40.490
Hey, what happened to our stealth suits?

00:17:40.660 --> 00:17:42.950
It's weird. Are they broken?

00:17:43.200 --> 00:17:44.370
Sensei! Over there!

00:17:48.750 --> 00:17:49.880
H-Hello.

00:17:50.170 --> 00:17:53.050
You bastards!

00:17:54.050 --> 00:17:57.010
Hey! Hold it right there!

00:17:58.300 --> 00:18:03.100
They were so brave, so I thought they were new club members.

00:18:03.680 --> 00:18:07.850
It certainly is strange to wear swimsuits like that.

00:18:09.230 --> 00:18:11.190
They were like ghosts in those swimsuits.

00:18:11.480 --> 00:18:13.360
Are you all right, Utsumi-san?

00:18:13.860 --> 00:18:14.990
Everyone, lend her a hand.

00:18:15.740 --> 00:18:17.570
I'll take Utsumi-sempai to the infirmary.

00:18:17.860 --> 00:18:18.320
Okay!

00:18:23.030 --> 00:18:23.740
Huh?

00:18:24.910 --> 00:18:27.620
Where'd everybody go?

00:18:32.000 --> 00:18:33.500
You bastards!

00:18:33.500 --> 00:18:35.340
I'll punish you for that!

00:18:35.340 --> 00:18:36.130
Yuusuke!

00:18:41.430 --> 00:18:42.140
Yuusuke.

00:18:42.930 --> 00:18:43.680
Riku-kun.

00:18:47.980 --> 00:18:48.770
You two...

00:18:50.230 --> 00:18:52.020
Hold it right there!

00:19:07.160 --> 00:19:09.410
She's so pretty.

00:19:14.750 --> 00:19:15.710
Aoba-san?

00:19:21.640 --> 00:19:22.510
Here you go.

00:19:23.600 --> 00:19:24.260
My...

00:19:24.720 --> 00:19:26.060
Thanks. It really helped.

00:19:27.470 --> 00:19:28.890
Did you clean it for me?

00:19:30.350 --> 00:19:32.100
Yes. I ironed it just in case.

00:19:33.440 --> 00:19:35.400
It's cleaner than before.

00:19:35.860 --> 00:19:37.360
I've got to say thanks.

00:19:39.570 --> 00:19:42.610
Well... You're a good swimmer, Yayoi-san.

00:19:42.950 --> 00:19:44.280
I was watching you earlier.

00:19:44.280 --> 00:19:45.740
How should I put it...

00:19:46.160 --> 00:19:47.410
You were very pretty.

00:19:48.370 --> 00:19:49.450
Oh dear!

00:19:49.450 --> 00:19:51.870
I'm not like that at all.

00:19:52.920 --> 00:19:54.250
Yes, you are!

00:19:54.630 --> 00:19:56.880
You were swimming so smoothly.

00:19:57.630 --> 00:19:58.420
What is it?

00:19:59.550 --> 00:20:00.420
I know!

00:20:00.420 --> 00:20:01.420
You were swimming like a dolphin.

00:20:02.340 --> 00:20:03.930
Like a dolphin?

00:20:04.640 --> 00:20:07.220
Sorry. Did I hurt your feelings?

00:20:10.270 --> 00:20:11.430
Did I say something strange?

00:20:12.480 --> 00:20:13.140
No.

00:20:13.600 --> 00:20:15.020
I'm very happy.

00:20:15.480 --> 00:20:16.690
Because I love dolphins.

00:20:17.520 --> 00:20:19.690
I see. Your dream...

00:20:20.070 --> 00:20:26.660
Yes. My dream is to see wild dolphins swimming in the ocean.

00:20:27.120 --> 00:20:30.200
If you swim the way you are now, you'll surely be able to swim with them.

00:20:31.790 --> 00:20:33.960
Thank you so much, Aoba-san.

00:20:37.130 --> 00:20:40.550
But I need to swim well during the competitions before I can do that.

00:20:40.920 --> 00:20:42.800
That's my short-term goal.

00:20:43.090 --> 00:20:44.970
Oh, you're in the competitions.

00:20:45.300 --> 00:20:46.010
What style do you use?

00:20:46.390 --> 00:20:47.260
The backstroke.

00:20:47.850 --> 00:20:51.560
But my times haven't been too good lately, so I've been worried.

00:20:52.680 --> 00:20:53.770
I see.

00:20:53.770 --> 00:20:56.020
But I don't think you should worry too much about it.

00:20:57.900 --> 00:21:01.990
If you worry and think about it, your body will become stiff.

00:21:02.690 --> 00:21:05.860
Don't let it bother you too much. Just let the water take care of everything.

00:21:06.570 --> 00:21:09.740
If you worry about it, you won't do well.

00:21:09.740 --> 00:21:10.830
Wouldn't it be nice to put your heart into your swimming?

00:21:14.120 --> 00:21:15.210
What's wrong, Yayoi-san?

00:21:15.710 --> 00:21:16.710
Your face is all red.

00:21:17.210 --> 00:21:19.290
I have to swim!

00:21:19.630 --> 00:21:20.420
I have to put my heart into it!

00:21:20.960 --> 00:21:22.420
W-Well, Aoba-san!

00:21:23.170 --> 00:21:23.840
Yes?

00:21:24.420 --> 00:21:28.090
If it's okay with you, will you be my swim coach?

00:21:28.760 --> 00:21:29.680
ME?!

00:21:30.930 --> 00:21:35.940
Well, I don't mean that you'll coach me on my strokes, but as an emotional support...

00:21:36.980 --> 00:21:38.650
What am I saying?

00:21:39.980 --> 00:21:44.070
A-Anyway, I'd like to hear your advice on various things.

00:21:45.610 --> 00:21:47.700
Okay. I'll do what I can.

00:21:48.160 --> 00:21:49.280
Really?

00:21:49.660 --> 00:21:50.370
Okay.

00:21:51.030 --> 00:21:52.330
Thank you so much.

00:21:53.500 --> 00:21:56.160
It's a promise, Aoba-san!

00:21:56.660 --> 00:21:57.420
Yeah.

00:21:57.420 --> 00:21:58.170
I got it.

00:21:58.960 --> 00:21:59.630
Okay.

00:22:05.170 --> 00:22:06.720
HOLD IT!!!

00:22:07.010 --> 00:22:08.590
Hold it right there!

00:22:09.590 --> 00:22:10.850
Behave yourselves!

00:22:10.850 --> 00:22:12.930
Please forgive us!

00:22:12.930 --> 00:22:16.140
What are those two doing?

00:22:31.830 --> 00:22:37.210
When the morning sunlight streams through the window,

00:22:37.040 --> 00:22:42.250
I immediately think of you.

00:22:43.250 --> 00:22:54.220
Our love began at first sight.

00:22:55.140 --> 00:23:00.230
We have a bright future!

00:23:00.270 --> 00:23:06.650
Because you are my destined man!

00:23:06.780 --> 00:23:17.330
I've always been searching for the feeling which broke my smile.

00:23:18.410 --> 00:23:24.340
I have grasped a piece of the miracle which fell into this world

00:23:24.290 --> 00:23:30.260
I will run toward you, my love!

00:23:30.130 --> 00:23:35.930
When we are together, we can overcome any obstacle!

00:23:35.510 --> 00:23:42.560
Our love is still young, but it's my treasure!

00:23:51.820 --> 00:23:53.990
Excuse me! Please give me a headband!

00:23:53.990 --> 00:23:55.070
Sure! Go ahead!

00:23:55.410 --> 00:23:57.540
I'll need a shovel to dig a hole, too.

00:23:57.700 --> 00:23:58.660
A big one, right?

00:23:59.080 --> 00:24:01.920
Yes. And I'll also need an anti-tank missile!

00:24:02.080 --> 00:24:05.540
They're from a military base.

00:24:05.880 --> 00:24:07.050
And that, and that.

00:24:07.250 --> 00:24:09.590
So, what're you gonna do with them?

00:24:10.270 --> 00:24:12.740
Next time on Tokimeki Memorial - Only Love,

00:24:13.380 --> 00:24:14.570
An Exciting Accident.

00:24:15.090 --> 00:24:15.880
Please watch it.

00:24:16.430 --> 00:24:18.440
Sports Day is a real contest!
